{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>Hear discipline and be wise</b> — He placed discipline first, as in the saying: whoever fears sin, his fear precedes his wisdom." "<b>And do not neglect</b> — It is interpreted as not reversing the order, but rather that one should learn discipline and afterward wisdom. And it is also interpreted as not reversing, or nullifying, or interrupting the discipline."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:35.441131134Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}